      "source": "includes/admin/class-bp-activity-filter-admin-panel.php",
      "note": "Shared hub, created only when no other Wbcom plugin has registered it ($GLOBALS['admin_page_hooks']['wbcomplugins'] empty). takeover_hub_landing() re-claims the landing render at admin_menu @999 so a legacy wbcom-wrapper plugin loading first does not win. Peer plugins are auto-discovered from $GLOBALS['submenu']['wbcomplugins']."
